#### Criar rede
docker network create vitor-network

#### Buildar container node
docker build -t node-server .

#### Rodando servidor node
docker run -d --name node-app --network vitor-network -p 3000:3000 node-server

### Buildar container sh
docker build --no-cache -f Dockerfile.test -t test-container .

### odando servidor test.sh
docker run --rm --name test-container --network vitor-network test-container


